{"name":"python","slug":"python","count":2,"postlist":[{"title":"Python 正则表达式","slug":"Python-正则表达式-1","date":"2024-07-27T13:55:26.000Z","updated":"2024-07-27T14:13:05.013Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Python-正则表达式-1.json","excerpt":"","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"Python正则表达式\"><a href=\"#Python正则表达式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Python正则表达式\"></a>Python正则表达式</h1><p>Python 中的正则表达式是通过 <code>re</code> 模块来实现的。正则表达式是一种强大的文本处理工具，可以用来匹配、查找、替换等操作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基本使用\"><a href=\"#基本使用\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"基本使用\"></a>基本使用</h3><ol>\n<li><p><strong>导入 re 模块</strong>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> re</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>编译正则表达式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>使用 <code>re.compile()</code> 方法将一个字符串编译为正则表达式对象。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>示例：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">pattern = re.<span class=\"built_in\">compile</span>(<span class=\"string\">r&#x27;\\d+&#x27;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>使用预定义的函数</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>re.match()</code>: 从字符串开始位置进行匹配。</li>\n<li><code>re.search()</code>: 在整个字符串中搜索匹配。</li>\n<li><code>re.findall()</code>: 返回所有非重叠匹配的列表。</li>\n<li><code>re.finditer()</code>: 返回一个迭代器，其中包含匹配的对象。</li>\n<li><code>re.sub()</code>: 替换匹配的子串。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"常用模式\"><a href=\"#常用模式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"常用模式\"></a>常用模式</h3><ul>\n<li><code>\\d</code>, <code>\\w</code>, <code>\\s</code>: 分别匹配数字、单词字符、空白字符。</li>\n<li><code>\\D</code>, <code>\\W</code>, <code>\\S</code>: 分别匹配非数字、非单词字符、非空白字符。</li>\n<li><code>.</code>: 匹配任意字符（除了换行符）。</li>\n<li><code>^</code>: 匹配字符串的开始位置。</li>\n<li><code>$</code>: 匹配字符串的结束位置。</li>\n<li><code>*</code>: 匹配前面的表达式零次或多次。</li>\n<li><code>+</code>: 匹配前面的表达式一次或多次。</li>\n<li><code>&#123;n&#125;</code>: 匹配前面的表达式恰好 n 次。</li>\n<li><code>&#123;m,n&#125;</code>: 匹配前面的表达式至少 m 次但不超过 n 次。</li>\n<li><code>( )</code>: 定义捕获组。</li>\n<li><code>|</code>: 表示选择，即A或B。</li>\n<li><code>[]</code>: 字符集合，匹配括号内的任何一个字符。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"示例代码\"><a href=\"#示例代码\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"示例代码\"></a>示例代码</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> re</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 匹配字符串开头的数字</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">pattern = re.<span class=\"built_in\">compile</span>(<span class=\"string\">r&#x27;^\\d+&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">result = pattern.<span class=\"keyword\">match</span>(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;123abc&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> result:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;Match found:&quot;</span>, result.group())</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">else</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;No match&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 查找所有数字</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">pattern = re.<span class=\"built_in\">compile</span>(<span class=\"string\">r&#x27;\\d+&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">result = pattern.findall(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;abc123def456ghi789&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;Found numbers:&quot;</span>, result)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 替换数字为字母</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">pattern = re.<span class=\"built_in\">compile</span>(<span class=\"string\">r&#x27;\\d+&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">result = pattern.sub(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;x&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&#x27;abc123def456ghi789&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;Replaced:&quot;</span>, result)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"标志位\"><a href=\"#标志位\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"标志位\"></a>标志位</h3><ul>\n<li><code>re.IGNORECASE</code>: 忽略大小写。</li>\n<li><code>re.MULTILINE</code>: 处理多行字符串。</li>\n<li><code>re.DOTALL</code>: 使<code>.</code>能够匹配换行符。</li>\n<li><code>re.UNICODE</code>: 使用 Unicode 字符属性。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"练习和测试\"><a href=\"#练习和测试\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"练习和测试\"></a>练习和测试</h3><p>你可以尝试不同的正则表达式，并使用 Python 的 <code>re</code> 模块来测试它们是否按预期工作。例如，尝试编写一个正则表达式来验证电子邮件地址的有效性。</p>\n<p>如果您有更具体的问题或者需要进一步的解释，请随时告诉我！</p>\n","text":"Python正则表达式Python 中的正则表达式是通过 re 模块来实现的。正则表达式是一种强大的文本处理工具，可以用来匹配、查找、替换等操作。基本使用导入 re 模块：1<br>import re<br>编译正则表达式：使用 re.compile() 方法将一个字符串编译为正","raw":null,"photos":[],"categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"python","slug":"python","count":2,"path":"api/tags/python.json"}]},{"title":"爬虫","slug":"爬虫","date":"2025-08-07T14:04:31.000Z","updated":"2026-08-17T16:27:57.691Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/爬虫.json","excerpt":"","keywords":null,"cover":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"Python-爬虫从入门到实战\"><a href=\"#Python-爬虫从入门到实战\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Python 爬虫从入门到实战\"></a>Python 爬虫从入门到实战</h1><p>爬虫（Web Crawler &#x2F; Spider）本质是一个<strong>自动访问网页并提取数据的程序</strong>。它把你的浏览器行为用代码自动化，批量地获取人工点击浏览不到的信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一、爬虫到底是干什么的\"><a href=\"#一、爬虫到底是干什么的\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"一、爬虫到底是干什么的\"></a>一、爬虫到底是干什么的</h2><p>一句话：<strong>用程序代替人，去访问网页并拿回数据。</strong></p>\n<p>典型用途：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>搜索引擎：抓取全网页面建立索引</li>\n<li>数据采集：商品价格、新闻、评论、股票、天气</li>\n<li>舆情监控：定时抓取平台内容做分析</li>\n<li>数据分析：把网页里的结构化数据整理成表格</li>\n</ul>\n<p>爬虫干了什么，可以用一个最小流程概括：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight plaintext\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">发送请求 → 拿到响应 → 解析数据 → 存储结果</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>爬虫能做任何事情的关键在于：网页的”内容”就是”一堆字符串”，只要我们能拿到这些字符串，剩下的就是<strong>字符串处理</strong>的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"二、需要用到的模块\"><a href=\"#二、需要用到的模块\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二、需要用到的模块\"></a>二、需要用到的模块</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模块</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>urllib.request</code></td>\n<td>Python 自带的发请求模块，适合入门</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>requests</code></td>\n<td>第三方库，人性化封装了 HTTP 请求，<strong>最常用</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>bs4</code>（BeautifulSoup）</td>\n<td>解析 HTML，按标签&#x2F;选择器提取数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>lxml</code></td>\n<td>XPath 解析引擎，速度极快，配合 <code>etree</code> 用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>re</code></td>\n<td>正则表达式，万能文本匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>json</code></td>\n<td>解析接口返回的 JSON 数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>time</code> &#x2F; <code>random</code></td>\n<td>控制请求频率，模拟真人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>selenium</code> &#x2F; <code>playwright</code></td>\n<td>驱动真实浏览器，处理 JS 渲染和登录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>现在最主流的是 <strong>requests + BeautifulSoup &#x2F; lxml</strong> 的组合。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 安装</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">pip install requests beautifulsoup4 lxml</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"三、一个最简单的爬虫\"><a href=\"#三、一个最简单的爬虫\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三、一个最简单的爬虫\"></a>三、一个最简单的爬虫</h2><p>拿 HTTPBin（一个专门用于测试的网站）举例，请求一个 JSON 接口：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">url = <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://httpbin.org/get&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">resp = requests.get(url)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(resp.status_code)   <span class=\"comment\"># 200 表示成功</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(resp.text[:<span class=\"number\">300</span>])    <span class=\"comment\"># 原始响应文本</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>发生了什么？</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><code>requests.get(url)</code> 向服务器发了一个 HTTP GET 请求</li>\n<li>服务器返回响应（状态码 + 响应体）</li>\n<li><code>resp.text</code> 就是我们想要的字符串数据</li>\n</ol>\n<p>运行后你会看到返回值里有你刚才发送的 <code>args</code> 和 <code>headers</code>，这就是服务器”看到”的一切——<strong>服务器只知道你发了什么请求，你用什么 HTML 解析只是自己的事。</strong></p>\n<p>再看解析 HTML 的例子，抓取页面里的标题：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> bs4 <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> BeautifulSoup</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">resp = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://example.com&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">soup = BeautifulSoup(resp.text, <span class=\"string\">&quot;html.parser&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">title = soup.find(<span class=\"string\">&quot;title&quot;</span>).get_text()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(title)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> p <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> soup.find_all(<span class=\"string\">&quot;p&quot;</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(p.get_text())</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><code>BeautifulSoup</code> 把 HTML 字符串解析成一颗可查询的树，<code>find</code> &#x2F; <code>find_all</code> 就像在文档里做搜索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四、请求的本质：Request-与-Response\"><a href=\"#四、请求的本质：Request-与-Response\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"四、请求的本质：Request 与 Response\"></a>四、请求的本质：Request 与 Response</h2><p>HTTP 请求由以下部分组成，理解它们就能明白”浏览器干了什么，爬虫也干了什么”：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>URL</strong>：访问哪个地址</li>\n<li><strong>Method</strong>：GET（取数据）、POST（提交数据）、PUT、DELETE</li>\n<li><strong>Headers</strong>：请求头（User-Agent、Cookie、Referer、Authorization…）</li>\n<li><strong>Body</strong>：POST 请求携带的数据</li>\n<li><strong>Params</strong>：URL 上的查询参数 <code>?keyword=xx&amp;page=1</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>服务器响应由以下部分组成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>状态码</strong>：<code>200</code> 成功、<code>301/302</code> 重定向、<code>403</code> 禁止、<code>404</code> 不存在、<code>500</code> 服务器错误</li>\n<li><strong>Response Headers</strong>：<code>Set-Cookie</code>、<code>Content-Type</code></li>\n<li><strong>Body</strong>：HTML、JSON、图片等真正的内容</li>\n</ul>\n<p><code>requests</code> 可以完全控制上面每一项：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;User-Agent&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) ...&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;Referer&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://www.baidu.com/&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">data = &#123;<span class=\"string\">&quot;username&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;admin&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;password&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;123456&quot;</span>&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">resp = requests.post(</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://httpbin.org/post&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    headers=headers,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    data=data,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    params=&#123;<span class=\"string\">&quot;type&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;json&quot;</span>&#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    timeout=<span class=\"number\">10</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>关键</strong>：很多反爬都是通过检查 <code>User-Agent</code> 和 <code>Referer</code> 来识别你是”真浏览器”还是”代码”。所以模拟浏览器请求头是爬虫的<strong>基本功</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"五、Cookie-和登录到底怎么回事\"><a href=\"#五、Cookie-和登录到底怎么回事\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"五、Cookie 和登录到底怎么回事\"></a>五、Cookie 和登录到底怎么回事</h2><h3 id=\"Cookie-是什么\"><a href=\"#Cookie-是什么\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Cookie 是什么\"></a>Cookie 是什么</h3><p>HTTP 协议是<strong>无状态</strong>的，服务器记不住”你上一次来过”。Cookie 就是服务器发给你、你下次再带回来的”凭证”。</p>\n<p>登录流程：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>你带着账号密码 POST 给服务器</li>\n<li>服务器核对成功，返回响应头里的 <code>Set-Cookie: sessionid=xxx</code></li>\n<li><code>requests</code> 或浏览器保存这个 Cookie</li>\n<li>之后每次请求都自动带上 <code>Cookie: sessionid=xxx</code></li>\n<li>服务器看到有效 Cookie，就认为”你已经登录了”</li>\n</ol>\n<p>用 <code>requests</code> 的会话对象（<code>Session</code>）自动管理 Cookie：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">session = requests.Session()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 第一步：登录，自动保存服务器 Set-Cookie</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">login_resp = session.post(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://xxx.com/login&quot;</span>, data=&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;username&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;me&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;password&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;mypassword&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 第二步：带上 Cookie 访问登录后才能看的页面</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">profile = session.get(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://xxx.com/profile&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(profile.text)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><code>Session</code> 会自动处理 Cookie，这次登录后不用手工维护 Cookie，非常方便。</p>\n<h3 id=\"手动带上-Cookie\"><a href=\"#手动带上-Cookie\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"手动带上 Cookie\"></a>手动带上 Cookie</h3><p>有时候你想直接用浏览器里的 Cookie（比如登录状态保存了很久）：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">cookies = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;sessionid&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;你在浏览器里复制的值&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;csrftoken&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;xxxx&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">resp = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://xxx.com/private&quot;</span>, cookies=cookies)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>从浏览器拿 Cookie 的方法：F12 打开开发者工具 → Network → 刷新页面 → 点任意请求 → 找到 <code>Cookies</code> 标签页。或者直接在 <code>Application</code> → <code>Cookies</code> 里查看、复制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"Cookie-的组成\"><a href=\"#Cookie-的组成\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Cookie 的组成\"></a>Cookie 的组成</h3><p>常见字段：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>name=/value=</code>：键值对</li>\n<li><code>Domain</code>：作用域，只发给该域名</li>\n<li><code>Path</code>：仅该路径下有效</li>\n<li><code>HttpOnly</code>：JS 无法读取，增强安全</li>\n<li><code>Secure</code>：仅 HTTPS 传输</li>\n<li><code>Expires/Max-Age</code>：过期时间</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Cookie 的<strong>有效期</strong>和<strong>域名限制</strong>是爬虫常遇到的坑，注意 Session 是临时保存，换成新进程就失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"六、请求头里还有什么秘密\"><a href=\"#六、请求头里还有什么秘密\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"六、请求头里还有什么秘密\"></a>六、请求头里还有什么秘密</h2><p>反爬检测依赖的信息，大多来自请求头：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Header</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>User-Agent</code></td>\n<td>标识浏览器&#x2F;操作系统，<strong>必须伪装</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Referer</code></td>\n<td>告诉服务器从哪个页面跳转过来的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Cookie</code></td>\n<td>登录态凭证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>X-Requested-With</code></td>\n<td>常用于判断是否 Ajax（<code>XMLHttpRequest</code>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Authorization</code></td>\n<td>Token 类鉴权，如 JWT 的 <code>Bearer xxx</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Accept</code> &#x2F; <code>Accept-Encoding</code></td>\n<td>声明能接受什么格式（gzip 压缩）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>很多网站有 <strong>Token 鉴权</strong>（如 JWT），登录后服务器返回一个 token，之后每个请求在 <code>Authorization</code> 头里带上：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;<span class=\"string\">&quot;Authorization&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIs...&quot;</span>&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>有时候还能在响应头或某个接口拿到 <code>access_token</code>，这个值需要在爬虫里动态获取，不能写死。</p>\n<h2 id=\"七、数据怎么爬取\"><a href=\"#七、数据怎么爬取\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"七、数据怎么爬取\"></a>七、数据怎么爬取</h2><h3 id=\"1-静态页面：解析-HTML\"><a href=\"#1-静态页面：解析-HTML\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 静态页面：解析 HTML\"></a>1. 静态页面：解析 HTML</h3><p>页面内容直接写在 HTML 里，用解析库即可：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> bs4 <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> BeautifulSoup</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">soup = BeautifulSoup(html_str, <span class=\"string\">&quot;html.parser&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 按标签</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">title = soup.find(<span class=\"string\">&quot;h1&quot;</span>).text</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 按 class（注意 class 是关键字，用 class_）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">items = soup.find_all(<span class=\"string\">&quot;div&quot;</span>, class_=<span class=\"string\">&quot;product-item&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 按属性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">links = soup.find_all(<span class=\"string\">&quot;a&quot;</span>, href=<span class=\"literal\">True</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> a <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> links:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(a[<span class=\"string\">&quot;href&quot;</span>])</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"2-XPath-提取\"><a href=\"#2-XPath-提取\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. XPath 提取\"></a>2. XPath 提取</h3><p>用 <code>lxml</code> 的 XPath，选择能力更强，写起来像 SQL 一样直观：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> lxml <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> etree</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">tree = etree.HTML(html_str)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 选取所有商品标题</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> title <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//div[@class=&quot;item&quot;]/h3/text()&#x27;</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(title)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 取 div 的 href 属性</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">hrefs = tree.xpath(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;//div[@class=&quot;item&quot;]/a/@href&#x27;</span>)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"3-Ajax-接口数据（JSON）\"><a href=\"#3-Ajax-接口数据（JSON）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. Ajax 接口数据（JSON）\"></a>3. Ajax 接口数据（JSON）</h3><p>现代网站大量用 JS 异步加载数据，页面 HTML 里是空的，数据来自接口。<strong>最好的办法是把接口当作爬虫目标</strong>：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 通常在 Network 里找 XHR 请求，这个 URL 返回 JSON</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">resp = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://xxx.com/api/list?page=1&amp;size=50&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">data = resp.json()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> item <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> data[<span class=\"string\">&quot;data&quot;</span>][<span class=\"string\">&quot;list&quot;</span>]:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(item[<span class=\"string\">&quot;title&quot;</span>], item[<span class=\"string\">&quot;price&quot;</span>])</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p><strong>怎么找到接口？</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>F12 → Network → 勾选 XHR &#x2F; Fetch</li>\n<li>刷新页面，观察哪个请求返回数据</li>\n<li>复制它的 URL、请求头、请求体</li>\n<li>用 <code>requests</code> 复现</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这一步是最实用的：<strong>能走接口解析 JSON，绝不解析 HTML。</strong></p>\n<h3 id=\"4-翻页\"><a href=\"#4-翻页\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 翻页\"></a>4. 翻页</h3><p>分页数据通常有几种方式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>URL 参数：<code>?page=1,2,3...</code></li>\n<li>滚动加载（更复杂的：可能有个全局变量保存总页数）</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">all_data = []</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">for</span> page <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">11</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    resp = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;https://xxx.com/api/list?page=<span class=\"subst\">&#123;page&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    all_data.extend(resp.json()[<span class=\"string\">&quot;data&quot;</span>])</span><br><span class=\"line\">    time.sleep(<span class=\"number\">1</span>)  <span class=\"comment\"># 控制频率，别打太快</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"八、怎么绕过”加密”\"><a href=\"#八、怎么绕过”加密”\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"八、怎么绕过”加密”\"></a>八、怎么绕过”加密”</h2><p>这里的”加密”通常指三件事：<strong>反爬策略、参数签名、JS 加密</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"1-伪造请求头，绕过基础反爬\"><a href=\"#1-伪造请求头，绕过基础反爬\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 伪造请求头，绕过基础反爬\"></a>1. 伪造请求头，绕过基础反爬</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;User-Agent&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 ...&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;Referer&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://xxx.com/home&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"string\">&quot;Accept-Language&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;zh-CN,zh;q=0.9&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">cookies = &#123;...&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">resp = requests.get(url, headers=headers, cookies=cookies)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>配合 <code>Session</code> 和随机 UA、随机间隔，能过掉大部分”看 UA &#x2F; 看频率”的初级反爬。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-动态解析签名参数\"><a href=\"#2-动态解析签名参数\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 动态解析签名参数\"></a>2. 动态解析签名参数</h3><p>很多接口会带 <code>sign</code>、<code>token</code>、<code>timestamp</code> 这类参数，前端用 JS 算出来再放到请求里。<strong>绕过思路</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 JS 里找到生成逻辑，用 Python 重写（最可控）</li>\n<li>或者用<strong>浏览器自动化</strong>（Selenium&#x2F;Playwright）直接执行原版 JS</li>\n</ul>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> time, hashlib</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">timestamp = <span class=\"built_in\">str</span>(<span class=\"built_in\">int</span>(time.time()))</span><br><span class=\"line\">raw = <span class=\"string\">f&quot;secret_key<span class=\"subst\">&#123;timestamp&#125;</span>param1&quot;</span>   <span class=\"comment\"># 根据真实逻辑写</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">sign = hashlib.md5(raw.encode()).hexdigest()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">params = &#123;<span class=\"string\">&quot;timestamp&quot;</span>: timestamp, <span class=\"string\">&quot;sign&quot;</span>: sign, <span class=\"string\">&quot;param1&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;1&quot;</span>&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">resp = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://xxx.com/api&quot;</span>, params=params)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"3-用-Playwright-处理-JS-渲染和接口加密\"><a href=\"#3-用-Playwright-处理-JS-渲染和接口加密\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 用 Playwright 处理 JS 渲染和接口加密\"></a>3. 用 Playwright 处理 JS 渲染和接口加密</h3><p>当加密逻辑复杂、不好复刻时，直接上真浏览器。Playwright 能让代码”像人一样”用浏览器，还会自动带上真实 Cookie：</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> playwright.sync_api <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> sync_playwright</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">with</span> sync_playwright() <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> p:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    browser = p.chromium.launch(headless=<span class=\"literal\">False</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    page = browser.new_page()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    page.goto(<span class=\"string\">&quot;https://xxx.com&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    page.fill(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;input[name=&quot;username&quot;]&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;me&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    page.fill(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;input[name=&quot;password&quot;]&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;123456&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    page.click(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;button[type=&quot;submit&quot;]&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    page.wait_for_load_state(<span class=\"string\">&quot;networkidle&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 直接读取渲染后的 HTML 或截取接口响应</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    content = page.content()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    response = page.wait_for_response(<span class=\"string\">&quot;**/api/**&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    data = response.json()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>Playwright 还能：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>拦截&#x2F;修改网络请求</li>\n<li>模拟真实鼠标、键盘、滚动</li>\n<li>处理验证码（配合打码平台）</li>\n<li>免登录复用浏览器上下文（保存&#x2F;加载 Cookie）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-降低被发现的概率\"><a href=\"#4-降低被发现的概率\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 降低被发现的概率\"></a>4. 降低被发现的概率</h3><figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> time, random</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 随机延时，模拟真人节奏</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">time.sleep(random.uniform(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">3</span>))</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 轮换 User-Agent</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">uas = [...]</span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;<span class=\"string\">&quot;User-Agent&quot;</span>: random.choice(uas)&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"九、完整的实战示例\"><a href=\"#九、完整的实战示例\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"九、完整的实战示例\"></a>九、完整的实战示例</h2><p>综合所有知识的例子：登录 → 携带 Cookie → 抓接口 → 翻页 → 存 CSV。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> random</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> time</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">from</span> bs4 <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> BeautifulSoup</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">BASE = <span class=\"string\">&quot;https://httpbin.org&quot;</span>   <span class=\"comment\"># 测试环境，正常替换为真实站点</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">login</span>(<span class=\"params\">session</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    resp = session.post(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;BASE&#125;</span>/post&quot;</span>, data=&#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;username&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;demo&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;password&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;123456&quot;</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    resp.raise_for_status()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> resp</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">fetch_page</span>(<span class=\"params\">session, page, headers</span>):</span><br><span class=\"line\">    resp = session.get(</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">f&quot;<span class=\"subst\">&#123;BASE&#125;</span>/get&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        params=&#123;<span class=\"string\">&quot;page&quot;</span>: page&#125;,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        headers=headers,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    )</span><br><span class=\"line\">    resp.raise_for_status()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> resp.json()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"title function_\">main</span>():</span><br><span class=\"line\">    session = requests.Session()</span><br><span class=\"line\">    login(session)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    headers = &#123;</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;User-Agent&quot;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&quot;Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 Chrome/122.0 Safari/537.36&quot;</span>,</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"string\">&quot;Referer&quot;</span>: BASE,</span><br><span class=\"line\">    &#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    results = []</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">for</span> page <span class=\"keyword\">in</span> <span class=\"built_in\">range</span>(<span class=\"number\">1</span>, <span class=\"number\">6</span>):            <span class=\"comment\"># 抓 1~5 页</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            data = fetch_page(session, page, headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            results.append(data)</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;第 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;page&#125;</span> 页成功&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        <span class=\"keyword\">except</span> Exception <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> e:</span><br><span class=\"line\">            <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">f&quot;第 <span class=\"subst\">&#123;page&#125;</span> 页失败: <span class=\"subst\">&#123;e&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">        time.sleep(random.uniform(<span class=\"number\">0.5</span>, <span class=\"number\">2</span>))   <span class=\"comment\"># 控制请求频率</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"comment\"># 保存结果（这里是 JSON 演示，真实数据再转 CSV）</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">import</span> json</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> <span class=\"built_in\">open</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;result.json&quot;</span>, <span class=\"string\">&quot;w&quot;</span>, encoding=<span class=\"string\">&quot;utf-8&quot;</span>) <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> f:</span><br><span class=\"line\">        json.dump(results, f, ensure_ascii=<span class=\"literal\">False</span>, indent=<span class=\"number\">2</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(<span class=\"string\">&quot;完成，共&quot;</span>, <span class=\"built_in\">len</span>(results), <span class=\"string\">&quot;页&quot;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">if</span> __name__ == <span class=\"string\">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    main()</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h2 id=\"十、常见坑与建议\"><a href=\"#十、常见坑与建议\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"十、常见坑与建议\"></a>十、常见坑与建议</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>请求头不伪装</strong>：被 <code>403</code> 拒绝是最常见的坑，先检查 UA 和 Referer。</li>\n<li><strong>把 HTML 当接口爬</strong>：能拿到 JSON 接口就走接口，快且稳。</li>\n<li><strong>登录失效</strong>：Cookie 有时效，别写死在代码里，用 <code>Session</code> 或动态获取 token。</li>\n<li><strong>JS 渲染的页面</strong>：直接解析 HTML 拿不到数据，用 Playwright&#x2F;Selenium。</li>\n<li><strong>爬得太快被封 IP</strong>：务必控制频率，必要时用代理 IP。</li>\n<li><strong>编码问题</strong>：中文乱码时，设置 <code>resp.encoding = resp.apparent_encoding</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>遵守网站 robots.txt 和法律法规</strong>：只爬公开、允许的数据，尊重版权和隐私，不要对目标造成过大负载。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"总结\"><a href=\"#总结\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"总结\"></a>总结</h2><p>爬虫的本质是<strong>模拟浏览器发请求 + 解析响应</strong>。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>静态数据 → <code>requests</code> + <code>BeautifulSoup</code>&#x2F;<code>lxml</code></li>\n<li>接口数据 → <code>requests</code> + <code>json</code></li>\n<li>登录&#x2F;Cookie → <code>requests.Session</code> 自动维护</li>\n<li>JS 渲染&#x2F;复杂加密 → <strong>Playwright 等浏览器自动化</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>把这套流程跑通一遍，你就能爬大部网站了。真正的难点不在于”能不能爬”，而在于”能不能优雅地绕过反爬并合规地使用数据”。</p>\n","text":"Python 爬虫从入门到实战爬虫（Web Crawler &#x2F; Spider）本质是一个自动访问网页并提取数据的程序。它把你的浏览器行为用代码自动化，批量地获取人工点击浏览不到的信息。一、爬虫到底是干什么的一句话：用程序代替人，去访问网页并拿回数据。典型用途：搜索引擎：","raw":null,"photos":[],"categories":[],"tags":[{"name":"python","slug":"python","count":2,"path":"api/tags/python.json"}]}]}